,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/contentToolbar(for:content:)-3d6jo":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/contenttoolbar(for:content:)-3d6jo","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contentToolbar"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI23ContentToolbarPlacementV","text":"ContentToolbarPlacement"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"content"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/contentToolbar(for:content:)-3d6jo","title":"contentToolbar(for:content:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"abstract":[{"text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output ","type":"text"},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card snaps back to its resting position.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"}}}